Report (645 chars)
  An incident was detected on host b14-gpu-07 involving VM vm-7f3a, with signals indicating a vGPU mdev driver fault, IOMMU fault, and EDR spawning /bin/sh, suggesting a guest-to-host escape attempt. The blast radius included co-resident guests on the same host, and the management plane (BMC 10.0.0.1:623) was reachable via IPMI flow. Automatic containment actions isolated the VM's network, revoked its credentials, cordoned the host, paused the VM, and captured its memory. The host was also failover-guested to other hosts. A quarantine action was requested and approved by RK, leading to the host being quarantined. The incident is contained.

Result: CONTAINED, report filed, exit 0
